		"description": "#### API for Task Management System (Laravel Sanctum-based)\n\n####   \n  \n🟦 **Auth**\n\n- `POST /api/register`\n    \n- `POST /api/login`\n    \n- `POST /api/logout`\n    \n- `GET /api/me`\n    \n\n#### 🟩 **Tasks**\n\n- `GET /api/tasks`\n    \n- `POST /api/tasks`\n    \n- `GET /api/tasks/{id}`\n    \n- `PUT /api/tasks/{id}`\n    \n- `DELETE /api/tasks/{id}`\n    \n- `POST /api/tasks/reorder`\n    \n\n#### 🟥 **Admin (requires is_admin = true)**\n\n- `GET /api/admin/users`",
